      "writtenOn": "2020-04-30T16:49:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think I can answer my own question. module_current will only contain classes from the non-updateable part and will not include any classes from the modules. There are some types provided by modules in the non-updateable part and they will be resolved by building against an earlier version of the system api (29) to break the cycle.",
      "parentUuid": "dce95f01_0f51d4b8",
      "revId": "3f7c16e13063169630e9370bc0cbccf74c0ee5b1",
